title: A selected symbol in the Symbols panel, only connected files, collapse-all and expand-all
folders: git-history
allow-log: no symbol named

wait 3000
right symbols
select double
wait 900
locate
wait 1200
mark symbol-selected
wait 500
connected on
wait 1200
mark connected-on
wait 500
fit
wait 1000
mark connected-fit
wait 500
connected off
wait 1000
fit
wait 900
right deps
goto src/main.rs
wait 1200
mark deps-of-main
wait 500
collapse-all
wait 1000
fit
wait 900
mark collapsed-all
wait 500
select double
wait 600
locate
wait 1000
mark symbol-in-collapsed
wait 500
expand-all
wait 1000
fit
wait 900
mark expanded-all
wait 500
select no_such_symbol
wait 500
quit
